{"metadata":{"externalID":"c:@F@samSelectDetailRegion","fragments":[{"text":"samSelectDetailRegion","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Function","modules":[{"name":"DotFaceCore"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"samSelectDetailRegion","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"func","role":"symbol","title":"samSelectDetailRegion"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:I","text":"int"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"samSelectDetailRegion"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"const"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/DotFaceCore\/documentation\/DotFaceCore\/sam_color_image","preciseIdentifier":"c:@S@sam_color_image","text":"SamColorImage"},{"kind":"text","text":" * "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"const"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:I","text":"int"},{"kind":"text","text":" * "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"detectedObjectBoundingBox"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:I","text":"int"},{"kind":"text","text":" * "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"selectedBoundingBox"},{"kind":"text","text":");"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"0 on success, or a non-zero error code on failure."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Analyzes the input image and identifies the most suitable 200x200 pixel","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"region (bounding box) with high level of details that intersects a given bounding box.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"detectedObjectBoundingBox"},{"type":"text","text":" is empty (width or height is 0), any region can be selected. Otherwise,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the selected region should have non-empty intersection with this bounding box. The selected region"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"should lie fully inside the input image."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If there is no region satisfying these conditions - if image width or height is smaller than 200","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or ","type":"text"},{"code":"detectedObjectBoundingBox","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" lies outside the image, the selected bounding box will be (0, 0, 200, 200).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["                                  a bounding box in the format (x, y, width, height)."],"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing"},{"code":["                                  return, contains the bounding box in the format (x, y, width, height),","                                  where width and height are always set to 200."],"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/DotFaceCore\/documentation\/DotFaceCore\/samSelectDetailRegion"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/DotFaceCore\/documentation\/DotFaceCore"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/dotfacecore\/samselectdetailregion"]}],"references":{"doc://DotFaceCore/documentation/DotFaceCore/sam_color_image":{"fragments":[{"text":"sam_color_image","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/DotFaceCore\/documentation\/DotFaceCore\/sam_color_image","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/dotfacecore\/sam_color_image","title":"sam_color_image","role":"symbol"},"doc://DotFaceCore/documentation/DotFaceCore/samSelectDetailRegion":{"title